# GREEN LIFE — PROJECT CONTEXT
Last updated: March 27, 2026

## WHAT IT IS
Green Life is a mobile app and movement. Point your phone at the world — we tell you the environmental impact of what you're looking at, honestly and without overstating precision. Built on Expo / React Native. Live on Lee's phone via Expo Go.

Tagline: "Be present. Have knowledge. Pay attention."
Founder: Lee Williams, Edelleye Digital, Tulsa OK

