## SCAN SCREEN — 3 MODES
- Food (primary):     live camera → shutter → photo preview → confirm → ResultScreen (mode: food)
- Material (primary): same flow → ResultScreen (mode: material)
- Barcode (secondary): live scan auto-fires → ResultScreen (mode: barcode)
- All modes: manual text search fallback at bottom panel
- Camera layout: cameraArea is flex:1 in normal flow, bottomPanel is below it (not overlapping)

## RESULT SCREEN — DATA SHAPES
Params received from ScanScreen:
  { type: 'photo', mode: 'food'|'material', image: base64, uri: string }
  { type: 'barcode', query: string, mode: 'barcode' }
  { type: 'search', query: string, mode: 'food'|'material'|'barcode' }

Food result shape (matches FoodLookupData from restaurant API spec):
  food.matched_name, food.kg_co2e_per_serving, food.impact_tier, food.confidence,
  food.serving_size_g, food.food_category, food.source_citation
  equivalents[]: { label, value, unit, icon } — miles driven, phone charges, tree days, streaming hours
  meta.sparks: { awarded, newTotal, isFirstScan, reason }

Material result shape (matches MaterialLookupData):
  material.matched_name, material.sustainability_rating, material.recyclable,
  material.compostable, material.decomposition_label, material.disposal_guidance,
  material.better_alternative, material.kg_co2e_per_unit

