## SPARKS — GAMIFICATION
Currency earned per scan, persisted server-side:
- Food photo scan (successful): 1 Spark
- Menu text lookup: 1 Spark
- Material scan: 1 Spark
- Table scan (N items): N Sparks
- First scan ever: +2 bonus

Community members are called Igniters — founding members who were here before the fire started.

## RESTAURANT API INTEGRATION — BUILT, NOT YET WIRED
Full backend spec written and delivered. Key files:
- visionService.ts — Google Vision API (food + material detection)
- foodEmissionService.ts — Food carbon lookup, 60+ foods, Agribalyse data
- materialImpactService.ts — 15 restaurant materials
- sparksService.ts — Sparks award + retrieve
- usdaService.ts — USDA FoodData Central enrichment (free)
- climatiqService.ts — Carbon fallback (100 free/month)

Database migrations (run in order):
  001_add_sparks_table.sql
  002_add_food_emission_factors.sql (requires pg_trgm extension)
  003_add_material_impacts.sql

API endpoints:
  POST /api/v1/lookup/image  (mode: food | material | product)
  GET  /api/v1/search         (mode: food | product)
  GET  /api/v1/user/sparks

Lookup chain (food):
  Vision API → exact match → alias → fuzzy (pg_trgm) → category fallback → Climatiq → NO_DATA_FOUND

